	abstract = {α-Synuclein co-pathology is common in Alzheimer's disease (AD) and is associated with faster cognitive decline, yet its impact on brain structural integrity remains unclear. We examined the extent to which α-synuclein pathology influences brain microstructural changes using diffusion tensor imaging in participants stratified by cognitive impairment status.},
